# dev fixture art (generated on demand, never committed)
__fixture__

# The Android CI workflow came in with the CHRTV migration as a NEW file, and the
# integration token is a GitHub App install without the `workflows` permission —
# so GitHub rejects any push that includes it, because creating a workflow file
# needs that permission. It is excluded here rather than deleted: the file is
# still on disk and can be re-added from the GitHub web UI, or by a token that
# has the permission. Without this entry `git add -A` silently re-adds it and
# every push fails.
.github/workflows/build-android.yml

# Shorts fixture clips — regenerate with: node tools/make-fixture-media.mjs
tools/fixture-media/
